  data: {
    LLM: '1. First dealer chosen randomly, deals 3 cards to each player and 4 to table\n2. If 2+ Aces on table, reshuffle and redeal\n3. Players take turns counterclockwise\n4. On turn: Play one card to capture cards summing to 15 (including by matching a single 15-value card, or making combinations that sum to 15)\n5. If capture made: Take captured cards and played card, store as trick\n6. If no capture: Played card stays on table\n7. After all play their 3 cards, dealer deals 3 more to each player\n8. Continue until all cards played\n9. Last player to capture takes remaining table cards\n10. Score points based on captured cards and declarations',
    Player: '1. First dealer chosen randomly, deals 3 cards to each player and 4 to table\n2. If 2+ Aces on table, reshuffle and redeal\n3. Players take turns counterclockwise\n4. On turn: Play one card to capture cards summing to 15 (including by matching a single 15-value card, or making combinations that sum to 15)\n5. If capture made: Take captured cards and played card, store as trick\n6. If no capture: Played card stays on table\n7. After all play their 3 cards, dealer deals 3 more to each player\n8. Continue until all cards played\n9. Last player to capture takes remaining table cards\n10. Score points based on captured cards and declarations',
    objective: 'Score points by capturing cards from the table (making combinations that sum to 15) and declaring special three-card combinations in hand. The game is played to an agreed target score (commonly 21 or 31 points).',
    gameplay: '1. First dealer chosen randomly, deals 3 cards to each player and 4 to table\n2. If 2+ Aces on table, reshuffle and redeal\n3. Players take turns counterclockwise\n4. On turn: Play one card to capture cards summing to 15 (including by matching a single 15-value card, or making combinations that sum to 15)\n5. If capture made: Take captured cards and played card, store as trick\n6. If no capture: Played card stays on table\n7. After all play their 3 cards, dealer deals 3 more to each player\n8. Continue until all cards played\n9. Last player to capture takes remaining table cards\n10. Score points based on captured cards and declarations',
